     "constraints": COMMON,
     "economy": "No subscriptions, persistence, or replication tonight — a map with helpers, nothing more.",
     "concept": "A shared world bus vs per-system private state"},
    {"title": "feat(core): NPC schedules from persona files, driven by world_time",
